*-resume.txt

# hud/ machine-written data. The HUD writes every snapshot, log, and index
# under $HUD_ROOT/.generated in the private content tree, never beside its
# code — these two lines are the backstop that keeps a regression there from
# publishing work data, not the mechanism.
hud/generated/
hud/.generated/
# ...and a repo-root .generated/, which a HUD run with HUD_ROOT=this-repo
# creates. It can hold peer handles and PR data; this repo is public.
.generated/

# hud/ apko + melange build artifacts. The signing key is generated per-clone
# by `melange keygen` and is a local build credential, not a release key —
# nothing verifies the image against it, so committing it would publish a
# private key to buy nothing.
hud/packages/
hud/melange.rsa
hud/melange.rsa.pub
hud/*.tar
hud/sbom-*.spdx.json

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key

# claim-ledger runtime data — WORK CONTENT, never commit
skills/claim-ledger/tally.jsonl
